    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Dutch national flag</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/sort-colors/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 75</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Sort Colors</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Three pointers split the array into four zones: 0s, 1s, unknown, 2s. Look at the first unknown value: a 0 goes to the 0-zone's end, a 1 stays, a 2 goes to the front of the 2-zone, and then you do not advance, because the value you got back is still unknown. One pass, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
  },
